{"generated": "2026-09-21 17:04", "curation": {"market": "최근 24시간 시장의 핵심 테마를 정리한 브리핑입니다.\n\n<b>코스피 7,000선 탈환과 반도체 강세</b>\n코스피가 반도체 수출 호조와 삼성전자 등 대형주의 급등에 힘입어 7거래일 만에 7,000선을 회복하며 상승 마감했습니다 [<a href=\"https://news.google.?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">#4</a> <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiUkFVX3lxTE90Q1d0dFpVcTRabWN4TjdDbVdycV9yUjBHc3RLeE5nNFdLSF9VMTh2eHpRaVVGZWQyOUxCUTNiMmxtMjJqVGg3TjdQN1B6WXJYWkE?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">#5</a> <a href=\"https://news.google.?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">#8</a> <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiZEFVX3lxTE1CbXg3TTR5QktyY09mR3d2ZHVIckVtU0dLZUF3U1d0Sjl5TnVUVDNWUjQyV1Y3ZTFQMEd2V2V6QjBES1E3TEpBVUFQblVnNDlXUXZ3YmZKUnZMR3NRd3FWWmJMY3o?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">#10</a> <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiakFVX3lxTE9DemNMVmZyYVV1UTBlOUNhOTVFR1JoZ1NtbzZtMF81RGRCb0xrbjlIYlpsUzY5V2w0c2pCcEFhQ3lvX245R1QwMC1ackFkWmM2LUV0VUhtY0JvaXF5cUltc3AwLTEzSTk2SHc?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">#11</a>]. 특히 삼성전자가 주가 상승을 견인한 가운데 코스닥 역시 반도체 장비 강세와 개인 순매수세로 1.11% 상승한 836.27로 마감했습니다 [<a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiY0FVX3lxTFB0S1dNaXR6NG9JNVo4SVVsNHpabDJMeEVUYnhQMHJaTlRLSmJMWktmeHg1clltRDRMdkwySDh3Nm9FN1hyNW0wbDNrQVc2b0EyaWk4QWlMUVd2dktqdlZzZWhBaw?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">#16</a> <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiUkFVX3lxTFAwYWJJbEpQWkZrUjRFZ25kT2NFNFpScUQ3bFVsU0stY1MzM29XLXFoYTlENUZGcXdQb1kwMEpTdlZCeDVFaVlQZUZZRkZmMHVtS3c?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">#21</a> <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiXEFVX3lxTFBqellDMUNCVG9GdjVYOW12LUlyYVg5ZjVDa1NXZWxpUGZheUpoVVlzOF9QRXVRWFVvd0Rlc2ZEeTd3T2lGZjRFQjA5T3FyN0tUZDRHWmVxQkVjb09x?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">#22</a>].\n\n<b>원/달러 환율 8거래일 만의 하락세 전환</b>\n강달러 압력 속에서 원/달러 환율이 추석 앞둔 네고 물량 유입 등의 영향으로 8거래일 만에 하락세로 돌아섰습니다 [<a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiakFVX3lxTFBrVzF3N2dVaTlPVHdVdmFfdElMZG14REgyZmV6Y2d